{"id": "8d4844b9-8c42-4ef1-b8ee-eb66d0493e76", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T08:40:14.366025", "source": "user", "parent_id": "ba934ca5-675a-4038-80e6-4ad7abc80626", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{\"researcher_request\": \"请先对工作区与可用资料进行一次有限的检查,并以设计为目的提出初步方案。请只提供以下三项内容,不要给出最终设计或结论。**(1) 输入/仓库勘察:** 简要说明 `/workspace` 中的目录结构、可读文件清单(`track.md` 等),以及是否存在 TorchOpt 源码、论文、教程或基准测试脚本等可引用材料;若不存在,请明确说明仅依据公开知识进行设计。**(2) 拟议实验方法概述:** 用 200–400 字概述如何比较 TorchOpt 显式梯度微分 API(复用中间结果、最小化内存分配)与 PyTorch 标准 autograd 在两类指标上的差异:计算时间与数值稳定性。请列出候选模型族(如 MLP、CNN、RNN/Transformer 小型配置)、候选数据集形状(如合成回归/分类、或者已有的玩具基准 MNIST/CIFAR-10 之一)、候选损失函数、候选优化器、候选 batch size 与步数、候选任务规模,以及拟采用的对照设置(成对运行、固定随机种子、warm-up、重复次数)。**(3) 关键假设与不确定性:** 说明本研究设计所依赖的、尚未由资料明确支持的假设,例如 TorchOpt 显式梯度的实现形式(是 functorch/functional API 还是自实现)、其内存复用机制的具体范围(只复用中间张量,还是忽略 graph 缓存)、可供运行的硬件、运行时预算、是否需要 GPU 等,并列出如 TorchOpt API 名称、版本、文档地址等需要进一步核实的事实点。请在末尾以 **事实待核实清单** 形式集中列出,以便后续澄清阶段使用。\", \"required_handoff_stage\": \"plan\", \"approach_approved\": false, \"public_task\": {\"question\": \"Will the explicit gradient differentiation API in TorchOpt, which reuses intermediate data and minimizes memory allocation, reduce computation time and improve numerical stability compared to standard autograd implementations?\", \"context\": \"Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.\", \"environment\": {\"runtime\": \"bubblewrap\", \"network\": \"disabled\", \"repository\": \"/workspace\", \"python\": \"python3\", \"software_environment\": \"system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled\", \"datasets\": [], \"gpu_enabled\": false, \"cpu_affinity_count\": 24, \"note\": \"Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment.\"}, \"researcher_topics\": [], \"question_budget\": 6, \"actor_step_budget\": 60, \"continue_after_initial_plan\": false}}"}], "tool_calls": nu